data: {"id": "52659c3f9e444b79-thinking-parallel_evidence-2351", "run_id": "52659c3f9e444b79", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 状态**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 当前为 **Pending (ContainerCreating)**，UID `3f9c97a0-dee7-484f-90ee-dcce79c0b28b`，调度到 **node2**，容器名为 **app**，镜像为 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`。\n2. **容器重启计数**：`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0`，表示容器尚未启动过，无重启。\n3. **等待原因**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 返回 `ContainerCreating`，值为 1，确认 Pod 处于容器创建等待阶段。\n4. **Phase 状态**：`kube_pod_status_phase = Pending (1)`，其他 phase (Running/Succeede", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788779122990, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

